{"_id":"5bf0542d3f6d2f7d","name":"Bec de Corbin","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Bludgeons","description":"This versatile long hammer has a sharp beak that concentratres the force of a blow. When you use the Mighty Strikes technick, each explosive damage die generates 2 additional dice, rather than 1. This weapon grants you reach 2.","cost":27400,"availability":"Rare","bulk":2,"weaponGroup":"bludgeons","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":4},"damage":{"formula":"2d10+4","type":"Blunt or Piercing"},"range":"Melee","capacity":0,"specialRules":"This versatile long hammer has a sharp beak that concentratres the force of a blow. When you use the Mighty Strikes technick, each explosive damage die generates 2 additional dice, rather than 1. This weapon grants you reach 2."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
