{"_id":"8e54a6cbd684c284","name":"Sharur","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Bludgeons","description":"This legendary great mace is one of the 9 divine artefacts. Sharur’s is treated as holy against targets either immune, resistant, or weak to holy damage. Additionally, should your attack roll beat both a target’s Ref and Fort Defence, the target becomes flat-footed and may take no actions until the start of your next turn. This is a stun. Evil creatures may not utilize Sharur’s special qualities. Requires 15 Str to wield.","cost":40900,"availability":"Legendary","bulk":2,"weaponGroup":"bludgeons","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":5},"damage":{"formula":"2d12+5","type":"Blunt"},"range":"Melee","capacity":0,"specialRules":"This legendary great mace is one of the 9 divine artefacts. Sharur’s is treated as holy against targets either immune, resistant, or weak to holy damage. Additionally, should your attack roll beat both a target’s Ref and Fort Defence, the target becomes flat-footed and may take no actions until the start of your next turn. This is a stun. Evil creatures may not utilize Sharur’s special qualities. Requires 15 Str to wield.","prerequisites":{"str":15}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
